        "id": 5210
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-21T13:10:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see how this improves readability or improves safety. The code that produces and uses the result is nearly the same. The rule above argues about using .second or get\u003c1\u003e(). This code never used the accessors. Done anyway.",
      "parentUuid": "1d766fb8_e50a7055",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 38,
        "startChar": 4,
