      "writtenOn": "2022-09-20T16:47:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this a necessary part of the change or just a separate tweak?\nI feel like the original `swap/reset` was simpler; it\u0027ll probably generate nearly equivalent code and it is less reliant on the internals of the class.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 84,
