      "writtenOn": "2022-09-21T13:10:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When thinking about lifetimes, I find reasoning about swaps hard. Here the lifetime of storage is clear. Swaps were a hack from a bygone era to get move-like behavior.",
